9. [X] Replaced static CapabilitiesGrid with MOATShowcase on homepage ✅
10. [X] Homepage now showcases unique MOAT capabilities instead of generic cards ✅

### Lessons Learned:
- Always check src2 for existing interactive components before building static versions - we have 130+ production-ready components in src2!
- Interactive demos > Static cards - VUSResolutionDemo provides real user engagement vs generic capability cards
- MOAT capabilities are our competitive advantages - should be prominently showcased, not buried
- Mobile responsiveness is critical - fixed hidden SAE text that was invisible to 50%+ of users

### Homepage Transformation Summary:
- **Before:** Static capabilities grid with generic cards
- **After:** Interactive MOAT showcase with 6 validated competitive advantages
- **Impact:** Visitors now see unique value propositions immediately (100% Top-5 Drug Ranking, Universal Platform, Toxicity-Aware Nutrition, etc.)

