### Next Steps:
- Install Mintlify CLI: `npm i -g mint`
- Run dev server: `cd docs-mintlify && mint dev`
- Add more API endpoints (Forge, Boltz, Command Center)
- Add integration guides and use cases
- Set up Mintlify hosting or integrate into Next.js app

### Lessons Learned:
- Mintlify uses MDX format for documentation pages
- Navigation structure defined in docs.json
- Can be hosted separately or integrated into Next.js
- API reference pages use special components (ParamField, ResponseField)
